<title>THAILAND: Thai money markets closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Thai money markets closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's money and foreign exchange markets were closed on Friday for Buddhist religious holiday.</p>
<p>The overnight interbank rate was quoted at 11.50-12.00 percent late on Thursday. The baht was at 25.970/25.980 to the dollar on Thursday.</p>
<p>The markets will reopen on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
